@startuml sequence-device-telemetry
!theme plain
title AniTec — Secuencia: ingesta de telemetría con clave de dispositivo (Iteración 6, Sprint 2)
' Fuente: anitec-backend (Devices, Metrics) — QAS-11

actor "Ganadero" as Rancher
participant "Dispositivo\n(collar, sensor)" as Device
participant "DeviceApiKeyFilter" as Filter
participant "DeviceTelemetryController" as Ctrl
participant "DeviceMetricCommandService" as Cmd
database "devices / device_metrics" as Db

== Emisión de la clave (una sola vez) ==
Rancher -> Ctrl : POST /devices/{id}/api-key (JWT de usuario)
Ctrl -> Db : guarda ApiKeyHash (SHA-256)
Ctrl --> Rancher : 200 { apiKey } (no se vuelve a mostrar)
Rancher -> Device : configura la clave en el dispositivo

== Lectura periódica ==
Device -> Filter : POST /devices/{id}/telemetry\nX-Device-Api-Key: ak_...
Filter -> Db : comparar el hash de la clave con ApiKeyHash
alt clave inválida o de otro dispositivo
  Filter --> Device : 401 Unauthorized
else clave válida
  Filter -> Ctrl : dispositivo autenticado
  Ctrl -> Cmd : IngestDeviceReadingCommand
  Cmd -> Db : última lectura del dispositivo
  alt lectura dentro del intervalo mínimo
    Cmd --> Ctrl : ReadingTooSoon
    Ctrl --> Device : 429 Too Many Requests (Retry-After)
  else intervalo cumplido
    Cmd -> Db : INSERT device_metrics (hora del servidor)
    Ctrl --> Device : 201 Created
  end
end
@enduml
